1.Description

   Designed and implemented a modern, responsive homepage hero section featuring an interactive promotional slider for the Pharma Store website. The hero section serves as the primary entry point for users, showcasing key healthcare services, featured promotions, medicine subscriptions, AI healthcare assistance, and call-to-action buttons to improve customer engagement and increase conversions.

   The implementation focused on creating a visually appealing, high-performance, and fully responsive hero section that aligns with modern healthcare and e-commerce design standards.

2.Business Requirement

   The homepage required an attractive hero section that effectively communicates the pharmacy's core services while encouraging users to explore products and healthcare solutions.

3.The hero banner needed to:

 *Introduce the Pharma Store brand.
 *Highlight healthcare services.
 *Promote medicine subscriptions.
 *Advertise AI Healthcare Assistant.
 *Improve customer engagement.
 *Increase product visibility.
 *Encourage prescription uploads.
 *Drive conversions through clear Call-to-Action (CTA) buttons.

